<article class="about-page narrow">
  <h1>About Commonbound</h1>
  <p>Isn’t it fascinating how AI is taking over jobs, but are we actually solving the most pressing problems on this planet?</p>
  <p>At Commonbound, we’re shifting how we think and talk about work. Instead of chasing job titles, we focus on the impact we want to have and the skills we acquire along the way.</p>
  <p>We’re just getting started. Our long-term vision is to build a platform where people can share and discover projects, find like-minded people, and collaborate on things that contribute to the greater good.</p>
  <p>Whether you’re a paid professional, a volunteer, or an activist, we don’t care about your status. We care about your why.</p>
  <p>Because what if we started thinking less about the jobs we have and more about the change we want to create?</p>
</article>
